    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "72 The Park is a well-located three-bedroom end-of-terrace home situated within the mature and established Millbrook Lawns development in Tallaght. The accommodation comprises three bedrooms, a family bathroom, a comfortable living area and a kitchen/dining space and a front parking space making this end-of-terrace-property a practical choice for those looking to put their own stamp on a home.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated in a well-established residential setting, with a good selection of amenities within easy reach. Local shops and services are close by, while Tallaght Village and The Square Shopping Centre provide an extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants and other everyday conveniences. For families, the location is particularly convenient, with a number of primary and secondary schools in the surrounding area. St Dominic's National School, Scoil Santain and the Naomh Maelruain schools are all within the wider local area, while Old Bawn Community School and other secondary schools are also accessible. Millbrook Lawns is ideally positioned off the Old Bawn Road, providing easy access to Tallaght and the surrounding areas. The area is well served by Dublin Bus, while the Tallaght Luas stop provides access to the Red Line and connections towards Dublin City Centre. The property is also conveniently located for Tallaght University Hospital, Tallaght Village and The Square, while the M50, N81 and N7 are readily accessible for commuters travelling by car."
      },
